### ============================================
### API Материалов Агенды Мероприятий
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@organizerToken = YOUR_ORGANIZER_TOKEN_HERE
@userToken = YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE
@eventId = YOUR_EVENT_ID_HERE
@agendaItemId = YOUR_AGENDA_ITEM_ID_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. Загрузить материал (PDF)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="presentation.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./uploads/materials/presentation.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### 2. Загрузить материал (DOCX)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./uploads/materials/document.docx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### 3. Загрузить материал (PPTX)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="slides.pptx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation

< ./uploads/materials/slides.pptx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### 4. Загрузить несколько материалов
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/upload-multiple
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="presentation.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./uploads/materials/presentation.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="handout.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./uploads/materials/handout.docx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="schedule.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./uploads/materials/schedule.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### 5. Получить список материалов (Организатор)
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### ============================================
### 5.1. Добавить внешний материал (официальный payload)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/link
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/xxx/view",
  "title": "Презентация спикера"
}

### ============================================
### 5.2. Добавить внешний материал (совместимость с фронтом)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/link
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "link": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/xxx/view",
  "name": "Презентация спикера"
}

### ============================================
### 6. Получить список материалов (Участник)
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ============================================
### 7. Скачать материал (Организатор)
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/download?fileUrl=/uploads/materials/uuid.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### ============================================
### 8. Скачать материал (Участник)
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/download?fileUrl=/uploads/materials/uuid.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ============================================
### 9. Удалить материал
### ============================================

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrl": "/uploads/materials/uuid.pdf"
}

### ============================================
### ТЕСТОВЫЕ СЦЕНАРИИ
### ============================================

### ============================================
### Сценарий 1: Полный цикл работы с материалами
### ============================================

### Шаг 1: Загрузить презентацию
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="presentation.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./uploads/materials/presentation.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Шаг 2: Получить список материалов
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Шаг 3: Скачать материал
# Используйте URL из ответа Шага 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials/download?fileUrl=/uploads/materials/uuid.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Шаг 4: Удалить материал
# Используйте URL из ответа Шага 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrl": "/uploads/materials/uuid.pdf"
}

### Шаг 5: Проверить, что материал удален
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/agenda/{{agendaItemId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

